-- 021 — Seed the Cosmo Mentor knowledge base.
--
-- Rows 10/20 are the curated platform + role facts. Everything from sort 100 is
-- the head trader's ACTUAL lesson narration, transcribed from the delivered
-- voice-over of the produced course videos (cosmos-studio / video-engine word
-- timings) — so the bot teaches what the course teaches, in his own framing.
-- Re-runnable: content is refreshed on conflict, admin edits to is_active/sort
-- are preserved.


INSERT INTO mentor_knowledge (slug, title, lesson_id, lang, sort, content)
VALUES ('platform-academy', $kb$How the academy works (platform facts)$kb$, NULL, NULL, 10, $kb$Cosmos Candles Academy — how it works.

The academy is a trading education platform with live Telegram signals, structured video lessons and a community. There are NO course fees: access is funded through a deposit at our partner broker TradeQuo (from 100 EUR). The deposit stays in the member's OWN broker account — it is their money, withdrawable anytime. It is not a payment to us.

Steps for a new member:
1. Register via the partner link (free account).
2. Watch the intro video.
3. Open an account at the partner broker (TradeQuo) and deposit at least 100 EUR.
4. Once the deposit is verified, the Telegram bot automatically unlocks the signal channel (personal invite).
5. Work through the lessons, follow the signals, grow tier by tier.

Tiers (unlock automatically on verified deposit):
- Foundation from 100 EUR: Telegram signal group, Foundation lessons, Cosmo Mentor (this AI assistant), weekly market recap, community chat.
- Operator from 2,000 EUR: everything in Foundation + automated Telegram trader (copy-trading from the master account), Operator lessons, live trading room.
- Elite from 50,000 EUR: everything in Operator + Elite lounge, 1:1 with the desk, portfolio audit, VIP events.

Staying active: members need to actually trade a small monthly lot minimum in a rolling 30-day window. Long full inactivity costs signal access after a grace period, and it comes back automatically as soon as they trade again. The minimum is deliberately low — it only filters out completely dead accounts.

Signals: delivered in a private Telegram channel (entry, stop-loss, take-profit). After a verified deposit the bot sends the personal invite automatically. The "Connect Telegram" button is on the dashboard.

The broker: TradeQuo, licensed (FSCA, CMA, FSA), 4.9 Trustpilot, proof of reserves, withdrawable anytime.$kb$)
